OL,3,GNEWSAPeople urged to go for 10 empty
OL,4,Alocal authority seats
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople are being urged to become
OL,7,Fmembers of their local authorities,
OL,8,Fwith the potential for 10 by-elections
OL,9,Facross the Isle of Man.
OL,11,FThe vacancies are available because of
OL,12,Fretirements, resignations, and the
OL,13,FHouse of Keys election in September
OL,14,Fwhere several former commissioners
OL,15,Fbecame MHKs.
OL,17,FThere are currently seats available in
OL,18,FArbory and Rushen, Ballaugh, Braddan,
OL,19,FDouglas Council's south ward, Garff's
OL,20,FLaxey ward, German, Michael, Peel, Port
OL,21,FSt Mary, and Ramsey.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
FL,449,445,260,140,0,100
